OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry this morning, but a
OL,6,Ffew showers across Galloway. This
OL,7,Fafternoon will be dry and rather
OL,8,Fcloudy, a few bright spells across
OL,9,FLothian and Borders.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with rain
OL,12,Fspreading from the west. Drier and
OL,13,Fclearer weather will develop during
OL,14,Fthe early hours. Fresh west or
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly winds at times.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,18,Fand scattered showers, these most
OL,19,Ffrequent across the north. Fresh to
OL,20,Fstrong westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
